~ entrance
do spawn_npc("res://resources/scenes/objects/NPCs/Cai.tscn", -16, 160)
do freezePlayer()
do get_npc("cai").walk_to(Vector2(1216,-688))
do wait(2)
do get_npc("cai").walk_to(Vector2(-16,-304))
do wait(2)
Cai: Lydia! 
Cai: Lydia this is an emergency! 
Cai: Hello?!
Cai: She must be in her lab. Come on
do get_npc("cai").walk_to(Vector2(1216,-688))
do wait(2)
do transitionRoom("MED_LAB_LAB", "MedLab")
=> END

~ walk_out
*Takes player's hand for walk*
Cai:  That was an exciting start, right? 
Cai: What all, uh, happened in there? I guess I just saw the aftermath.
Don't want to talk about it.
Cai: I see. Fair enough, I'll ask her what happened for my report later.
There was a big monster, and it hurt her.
Cai: Oh, well, I'm glad you weren't hurt too much. 
*If player is less than half health*
Cai: We can stop by later again to get you fixed up, but I think I have some bandages, which should do.
=> END
